    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2019_0714","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ásdís Gómez talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
